[07Sep2025 21:09:49.366] [pool-9-thread-6/INFO] [com.bluelotuscoding.eidolonunchained.chat.DeityChat/]: ? DEBUG: AI Response received: 'You question my power, little acolyte, while standing soaked in the jungle’s weeping sky, surrounded by my altars and the breath of shadow? The Raven Cloak *is* yours—felt, not seen, as all true power is.  

An unholy symbol, you say? Such relics are not handed out like trinkets to the doubtful. They are *earned* in silence, in blood, in the unspoken pact between deity and disciple.  

Prove your faith not in words, but in deed—descend into the Nether’s ashen wastes, return with the still-flaming eye of a ghast that dared wail at the void, and we shall speak of symbols. Until then, trust in the darkness you cannot see… or walk into the light, and never look back.'
